{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch the feeds. Spot the intrusions. Hold the line.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vast, unknowable entities have become irresistibly drawn to the noise and chaos of humanity\u2014like a storm collapsing upon a flickering candle. Their efforts to enter our world have fractured reality, creating <strong>BREACHES</strong>\u2014unnatural rifts where the fabric of existence wears thin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor surveillance feeds across key locations. Detect and report Breaches. Let too many Breaches slip by, and it's <strong>Game Over</strong>\u2014not just for you, but for all of us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BE EVER VIGILANT. GOOD LUCK.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760820/extras/c215b2c4ff08275bf784c5145022cbbe.poster.avif?t=1760534792\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760820/extras/c215b2c4ff08275bf784c5145022cbbe.webm?t=1760534792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760820/extras/c215b2c4ff08275bf784c5145022cbbe.mp4?t=1760534792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Surveillance Horror Gameplay</strong><br>Spot subtle (and not-so-subtle) changes in up to 5 live camera feeds per level. Miss too many and face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotage and Disruption</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Breaches aren't the only threat. Stay sharp\u2014<strong>unknown forces are actively working to sabotage your watch</strong>. Expect <strong>planted explosives</strong>, <strong>booby traps</strong>, and <strong>camera interference</strong> designed to shatter your focus. These hazards demand <strong>immediate attention</strong>\u2014hesitation only results in failure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760820/extras/b550d5c0ddddee778ca4cd217fd3ef12.poster.avif?t=1760534792\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760820/extras/b550d5c0ddddee778ca4cd217fd3ef12.webm?t=1760534792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760820/extras/b550d5c0ddddee778ca4cd217fd3ef12.mp4?t=1760534792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- <strong>8 Atmospheric Levels at launch.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location offers a distinct flavor of dread, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Carnival</strong> \u2013 Once joyous, now twisted and abandoned</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Outpost</strong> \u2013 Isolated. Storm-wracked. Not alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0Hospital</strong> \u2013 They don\u2019t rest in peace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Theatre</strong> \u2013 One final, haunting performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Safe House</strong> \u2013 It wasn\u2019t safe enough</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Haunted Mansion</strong> \u2013 Echoes and shadows cling to the walls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Empty House</strong> \u2013 A fire still burns. Dinner is served. No one's home</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Cyberlab</strong> \u2013 Experiments incomplete... but still alive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 600 Unique Breaches</strong> <br>Each level features 3\u20135 camera feeds, and every feed contains at least 20 handcrafted, reality-defying Breaches. That\u2019s up to 100 unique events per level to <strong>learn</strong>, <strong>spot</strong>, and <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760820/extras/5e3acda41aa5a96b92a42ffbeef896bf.poster.avif?t=1760534792\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760820/extras/5e3acda41aa5a96b92a42ffbeef896bf.webm?t=1760534792\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3760820/extras/5e3acda41aa5a96b92a42ffbeef896bf.mp4?t=1760534792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Inpatient","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760820/dcb9c09ab617a58746591994f1e9785072a0cee5.jpg"},{"name":"Should\u2019ve Knocked First","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760820/2e544abf01cf696d457b2a21f2578649e79500ea.jpg"},{"name":"No Tickets, No Queues, No Witnesses","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760820/f8bbb6191647fb92c4def10c46f41984429d4a50.jpg"},{"name":"Ethics.exe Not Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760820/9b410d3c5bf0ef57a36b0945d1e76b39874b2444.jpg"},{"name":"Rehearsal For The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3760820/e387e7603fe09772c0d787cbcc301eca0e75240a.jpg"},